  <History Date="29-05-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="25-11-13" Author="Sebastian Beutel" Comment="Created feom JB A8" />
  <History Date="12-01-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added channel count to mode names.  Increased wheel resolution of strobe and c-mix functions." />
  <History Date="12-01-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Renamed hue and saturation functions from Raw DMX and changed to percentage ranges." />
  <History Date="12-01-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed Classic manufacturer shortcode from EX to EP.  Updated palettes and macros." />
  <History Date="11-02-14" Author="RGB Power on Updater" Comment="Updated RGB Power on values to match Locate." />
  <History Date="10-12-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed dimmer to intensity in HSI modes and linked to vdim for compatibility" />
  <History Date="10-12-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised display name.  Revised colour macro functions." />
  <History Date="05-05-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's.  Added product thumbnail." />
  <History Date="05-05-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed name from TourWash 76 to TourWash Compact 76" />
